### Python ###
# The pack tools are scripts, not a package, but generate_gui_panels.py imports the PNG writer
# out of generate_dummy_textures.py rather than keeping a second copy of it - and an import is
# what makes CPython write a cache directory. Anchored, like every other directory pattern here.
/resource-pack/tools/__pycache__/

